        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8531TASK, Straight Knurled Leverset with Quincy Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you want to update your traditionally styled home, the Straight Knurled Lever with Quincy Rose might be perfect for you. This Leverset from Emtek merges new looks with a traditional feel for a stylish take on door hardware. The Straight Knurled Leverset with Quincy Rosette's reed design adds a point of interest while still looking sleek and polished. This Straight Knurled T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy sets; and it will fit most pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-TASK-specifications.gif?v=1704354641\" width=\"600\" height=\"162\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek TA Straight Knurled Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the T-Bar Straight Knurled Door Lever with Quincy Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Straight Knurled T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-TASK-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262405\"><b>Emtek T-Bar Straight Knurled Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Straight Knurled Lever with Quincy Rose",
                "description": "If you want to update your traditionally styled home, the Straight Knurled Lever with Quincy Rose might be perfect for you. This Leverset from Emtek merges new looks with a traditional feel for a stylish take on door hardware. The Straight Knurled Leverset with Quincy Rosette's reed design adds a point of interest while still looking sleek and polished. This Straight Knurled T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy sets; and it will fit most pre-drilled doors.\r\n",
                "keywords": "T-Bar Straight Knurled with Quincy Roses, Straight Knurled Lever with Quincy Roses, Emtek 8531TASK, EMT-8531TASK, straight Knurled T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Roses, T-Bar Straight Knurled Door Lever with Quincy Roses, Straight Knurled Leverset with Quincy Rosettes, Emtek 8531TASK dummy levers, Emtek 8131TASK passage levers, Emtek 8231TASK privacy levers, reed door levers, reed door hardware,"
